The [[Gloves of Power]] are neutral [[Gloves]] normally obtained by combining [[Gloves of Haste]] with a [[Stone Skin Potion]]. They make [[Weapon]]s near the "wrists" deal more damage and gain some {{icon/block}} on hit, but attack slower. Inherently this effect is mostly good, since the damage raises more than the speed is reduced, the speed reduction saves stamina, and {{icon/block}} is granted on top of it, but there may be a handful of builds and/or weapons where the attack speed reduction isn't worth it due to existing powerful '''on hit''' effects.
